# Generated gqlize schema artifacts. Committed for examples/gqlize-basic, where
# the pair is a reviewable build output that CI diffs (the "Schema drift" step
# in .github/workflows/ci.yml); rebuild with `pnpm schema:build`. Ignored for
# every other example until one opts in the same way.
/examples/*/generated/**
!/examples/gqlize-basic/generated/**

